21	 * owner) and before {@link SaveOwner}. The membership number, its Luhn check digit, the create
22	 * audit line and the derived locality all read this identity.
23	 *
24	 * <p>If the computed code collides with an existing owner's {@code customerCode}, it is
25	 * de-duplicated by appending {@code -<n>} with the smallest {@code n} of 2 or more that makes it
26	 * unique.
27	 */
